sn47.18:4.6 | S: The four kinds of mindfulness meditation are the path to convergence. They are in order to purify sentient beings, to get past sorrow and crying, to make an end of pain and sadness, to discover the system, and to realize extinguishment.” | T: that is, the four establishments of mindfulness.”
